# Line endings are load-bearing in this repository.
#
# The functional fixture under evals/functional/fixture/repos/ is pushed to
# Azure DevOps and then read back and compared byte-for-byte. A checkout that
# translates LF to CRLF changes those bytes and fails the comparison, so the
# checkout must not translate. core.autocrlf=true is the Git for Windows
# installer default and arrives at system scope on every Windows clone; these
# rules override it per path rather than asking each clone to reconfigure.

* text=auto

*.yml  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=lf
